{"id":"a45ef7e2abb0668f","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa.md","title":"ZFC Chain Condition Kappa","display":"df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa — ZFC Chain Condition Kappa","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa","aliases":["58-df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa"],"display":"df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa — ZFC Chain Condition Kappa","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-chain-condition-kappa — ZFC Chain Condition Kappa"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}kappa} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\bigl(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\bigr)\\to |A|&lt;\\kappa\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}kappa} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\bigl(p\\neq q\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\bigr)\\to |A|&lt;\\kappa\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every antichain of pairwise incompatible conditions has cardinality strictly below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}chain\\text{-}condition\\text{-}kappa} \\vdash \\mathrm{KappaChainCondition}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall p,q\\in A\\;\\big